              VeriGuard: Enhancing LLM Agent Safety via Verified Code Generation
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__item small-text">
                      
                        Mirko Montanari
                      
                    </div>
                
              
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__spacer"></div>
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__item small-text">
                      
