          <a class="row-card__heading glue-link" href=https://research.google/pubs/coda-agentic-systems-for-collaborative-data-visualization/ >
            
              CoDA: Agentic Systems for Collaborative Data Visualization
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
